      "description": "At narrow widths the inspector is an explicitly opened complementary panel above the model stage; opening it closes structure.",
      "html": "<aside class=\"ds-panel\" aria-label=\"Reference and selection\"><div class=\"ds-panel-header\"><span>Inspector</span><button class=\"ds-panel-close\" aria-label=\"Close inspector\"><svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 6 12 12M18 6 6 18\"/></svg></button></div><section class=\"ds-panel-body\"><h2>Selected part</h2><p>Reference and checks remain scoped to this occurrence.</p></section></aside>",
